# Local agent skill libraries. These are tooling, not application source: they
# ship their own example apps and lockfiles, which GitHub then reports as
# project vulnerabilities and CodeQL scans as production code. They are already
# excluded from the deploy artifact by build.js and .vercelignore.
/.agents/
/Traffic/.agents/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
node_modules/
Traffic/col-auth.js
Traffic/col-ui.css

# ── Raw asset dumps ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Source packs dropped in wholesale: ~1.3 GB across 4000+ files, almost all of it
# in formats the game never loads (Godot .tscn/.gd, .blend, .fbx, .obj) or in
# source-DCC audio (1.09 GB of WAV). scripts/stage_assets.py extracts the usable
# slice into Traffic/Models/props and Traffic/audio, and THOSE are tracked — so
# nothing the game needs is lost by ignoring the dump. Build.js also deny-lists it.
/Traffic/Models And SFX/
